vars {
  baseUrl: http://127.0.0.1:8808
  token: 
  documentId: 1
}

docs {
  Auth is now a short-lived OpenEMR-minted session token, NOT the old reusable
  bearer (revoked). Run "00 Mint dev token" FIRST — it hits /dev/token and sets
  {{token}}. That endpoint requires the sidecar running locally with
  COPILOT_AUTH_DEV_MODE=true (dev only; it is 404 in production). Against a real
  deployment, paste a token from the OpenEMR Co-Pilot panel into {{token}}.
}
